      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Both of these have been requested in separate posts. You should go upvote them!\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/notifications-when-friends-come-online\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/in-game-messaging-system\nAlso, feel free to comment on them if you have anything else to say on the matter!",
