  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-08-09T19:08:49.997Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not everyone who's friends in game are friends in other apps like discord, steam, etc. so I think a basic notification system that can alert a user when someone comes online would be nice. Maybe even set the option to be off by default and you can individually turn it on and off by each individual friend. \n\nAlso, I think an in-game messaging system could be very useful in letting users have more open forms of communication between each other. I'd leave it to only friends being able to message each other.",
